  <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Thermistor motor protection relays</h1>
  <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 30px;">CM-MSS.22 and CM-MSS.23</h2>

  <div style="display: flex; gap: 50px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">The thermistor motor protection relays <span data-field="model_name_1">{{ model_name_1 }}</span> and <span data-field="model_name_2">{{ model_name_2 }}</span> monitor the winding temperature of motors and protect them from overheating, overload and insufficient cooling.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">The devices are available with two different terminal versions. You can choose between the proven screw connection technology (double-chamber cage connection terminals) and the completely tool-free Easy Connect Technology (push-in terminals).</p>

      <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Characteristics</h3>
