        <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">2 Indication of operational states with LEDs</p>
        <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">U: green LED - Status indication of control supply voltage</p>
        <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">F: red LED - Fault message</p>
